sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as 사용자
  participant Web as Web App
  participant API as Auth API
  participant DB as User Store
  participant Mail as Mail Service

  User->>Web: Open login page
  Web-->>User: Show form
  User->>+Web: Submit credentials
  Web->>+API: POST /login
  API->>API: Hash password
  API->>+DB: Find user by email
  DB-->>-API: User record
  Note right of DB: Lookups are cached for 60 s
  alt Password matches
    API-->>Web: Session token
    Web-->>-User: Redirect to dashboard
  else Too many failures
    API-)Mail: Send lock notice
    API--xWeb: 423 Locked
    Web-->>User: 계정이 잠겼습니다
  end
  loop Every 5 minutes
    Web->>API: Refresh session
  end
  Note over User,Web: Session ends on logout
  deactivate API
